      <activity id="4325f19c-1777-5306-9d28-081943c0834e" activityNameId="4b48ed6c-f8f7-5098-bbb6-08235504e97d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, production NORDEL, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, production NORDEL, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: 047ab1f6-a749-3f87-b6f8-9e7b058e85af
Included are the electricity production using , the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Ozone- and NO2-emission factors are based on published measurements made in various countries.  Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swissdata.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Statistics for 2008
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_047ab1f6-a749-3f87-b6f8-9e7b058e85af.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
